What is Airline Catering?
Airline catering encompasses the comprehensive ecosystem of food preparation, packaging, and logistics services for commercial aviation. It spans everything from economy-class meal trays to bespoke first-class dining experiences, while addressing diverse dietary needs including halal, kosher, vegan, and allergen-free options. The industry operates under stringent aviation food safety standards, requiring precision timing to deliver thousands of meals daily within tight flight turnaround windows.

